# Astro generated types and caches
.astro/

# Collected applicant data: read from real people's public profiles, never committed.
data/*
# The event's companies are public information and the same for everyone, so they are shared.
!data/companies.json
# So is the list of public portfolio addresses the test applicants are collected from. What
# is read from those pages (applicants.json) is not.
!data/seeds.json

# The root .gitignore excludes every .env file; the example with empty values is committed.
!.env.example
